=== PART 2: 11a1 CORRECTED COMPUTATION ===
PARI lfuncreate(ellinit("11a1")) uses ARITHMETIC normalization (critical line Re(s)=1).
Zeros at s=1+i*gamma_f. Correct formula: L'(1+i*gamma_f).

Target: 2/(3*pi) = 0.212206590789193781025178351163
u_f(T) = Sum_{0<gamma_f<=T} |L'(1+i*gamma_f)|^2 / (T * log(T)^4)

